<mjml>
 <mj-head><mj-title>Welcome to Kwonnet</mj-title><mj-preview>You belong here. Let’s create something worth sharing.</mj-preview>
  <mj-attributes><mj-all font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" /><mj-text font-size="16px" line-height="26px" color="#263446" /><mj-button background-color="#0084C7" color="#ffffff" border-radius="8px" font-size="16px" font-weight="bold" padding="12px 24px" /></mj-attributes>
 </mj-head>
 <mj-body background-color="#eef4f8" width="600px">
  <mj-section padding="32px 24px 20px"><mj-column><mj-image src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Kwonnet" width="64px" href="{{appUrl}}"/><mj-text align="center" color="#0084C7" font-size="28px" font-weight="bold">Kwonnet</mj-text></mj-column></mj-section>
  <mj-wrapper background-color="#ffffff" border-radius="16px" padding="12px 16px 24px">
   <mj-section padding="12px"><mj-column>
    <mj-text font-size="28px" line-height="36px" font-weight="bold">Your next chapter starts here.</mj-text>
    <mj-text>Hi {{name}},</mj-text>
    <mj-text>I’m Kelvin Torver Peter, Founder and CEO of Kwonnet. Thank you for joining me on this journey. I’m building a place where your ideas, stories and creativity can find a community—and I’m glad you’re part of it.</mj-text>
    <mj-text>You can publish posts, share photos and videos, join conversations, discover creators and trending topics, and explore our games. Complete engagement tasks to earn bonus coins, and use your wallet to manage your coins and support other creators with tips.</mj-text>
    <mj-text font-weight="bold">Keep creating. Your next post could spark someone’s next great idea.</mj-text>
    <mj-text>Tell us what you’re working on, share what you’ve learned, or simply introduce yourself. You don’t need a perfect first post. You just need to begin.</mj-text>
    <mj-button href="{{appUrl}}">Create your first post</mj-button>
    <mj-divider border-color="#e3edf3" padding="24px 25px" />
    <mj-text>Welcome aboard,<br /><strong>Kelvin Torver Peter</strong><br />Founder &amp; CEO, Kwonnet</mj-text>
   </mj-column></mj-section>
  </mj-wrapper>
  <mj-section padding="16px 24px 32px"><mj-column><mj-text align="center" font-size="12px" line-height="18px" color="#62748a">Kwonnet - Connecting the dots and nodes<br /><br />You received this welcome message because you created a Kwonnet account.<br /><a href="{{appUrl}}/privacy-policy" style="color:#0084C7">Privacy policy</a> · <a href="{{appUrl}}/terms-of-service" style="color:#0084C7">Terms of service</a></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section>
 </mj-body>
</mjml>
